# test: server_suspend_notification
# description: Attached sessions are told that the server is suspending

## Environment

terminal:
  name: T1

terminal:
  name: T2

## Test

@T1
> amux new test-agent --name suspend-notify
> keepalive

@T2
> amux server suspend
Suspended 1 agent(s).

@T1
keepalive
echo: keepalive

[server suspending]
